   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves along the curve \\( x^{2} + x y = 10 \\) so that its coordinates \\( x \\) and \\( y \\) are differentiable functions of time \\( t \\). At the instant the particle is at the point \\( (2, 3) \\), the \\( y \\)-coordinate of the particle is decreasing at a rate of 5 units per second. Find \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} \\), in units per second, at that instant."
   },
