      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "At \\( (2, 3) \\) the coefficient of \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\) is \\( 2 \\) and the coefficient of \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} \\) is \\( 7 \\). Substitute \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} = -5 \\): \\( (2)(-5) + (7)\\frac{dx}{dt} = 0 \\).",
         "mathjson": -10
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Solve for the requested rate: \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = \\frac{10}{7} \\).",
